{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13919","headline":"发南康夜泊灨石中 · 耿湋","name":"发南康夜泊灨石中","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"倦客乘归舟，春溪杳将暮。\n羣林结暝色，孤泊有佳趣。\n夜山转长江，赤月吐深树。\n飒飒松上吹，泛泛花间露。\n险石俯潭涡，跳湍碍沿泝。\n岂唯垂堂戒，兼以临深惧。\n稍出回雁峰，明登斩蛟柱。\n连云向重山，杳未见锺路。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13919.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13919","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}